# Step iOS Design System

> Full specification: `documents/DesignSystem.md`
> Token definitions: `step/Config/DesignTokens.swift`
> Color definitions: `step/Config/ThemeConfiguration.swift`
> Color accessors: `step/Utils/AppColors.swift`
> Typography engine: `step/Extensions/Font+SystemScaling.swift`

## Typography — Use Semantic Tokens

Always use `DesignTokens.Typography.*` tokens via `.scaledFont()`:

| Token | Size / Weight | Usage |
|---|---|---|
| `.display` | 34pt bold rounded | Hero numbers, stats |
| `.displayMono` | 34pt bold monospaced | Timers, scores |
| `.heading` | 28pt semibold rounded | Screen titles |
| `.title` | 24pt semibold rounded | Card titles, section headings |
| `.titleSmall` | 20pt medium | Sub-section titles |
| `.bodyLarge` | 18pt semibold | Emphasized body |
| `.body` | 16pt regular | Default body text |
| `.bodyMedium` | 16pt medium | Emphasized callouts |
| `.buttonLabel` | 17pt semibold | Button labels, CTAs |
| `.label` | 15pt medium | Small card titles, tags |
| `.bodySmall` | 14pt regular | Card descriptions, secondary body text |
| `.bodySmallMedium` | 14pt medium | Card action labels, emphasized small text |
| `.caption` | 13pt regular | Footnotes, timestamps |
| `.captionSmall` | 12pt regular | Small metadata |
| `.overline` | 11pt medium +tracking | UPPERCASE section markers |
| `.micro` | 10pt medium | Tab bar labels |

```swift
Text("Title").scaledFont(DesignTokens.Typography.title)
```

**Never** use `.font(.system(size:weight:))` — it bypasses Dynamic Type.

## Spacing — 8pt Scale

```swift
DesignTokens.Spacing.xxs  // 2pt — hairline
DesignTokens.Spacing.xs   // 4pt — minimal
DesignTokens.Spacing.sm   // 8pt — tight
DesignTokens.Spacing.md   // 12pt — card gaps
DesignTokens.Spacing.base // 16pt — card padding
DesignTokens.Spacing.lg   // 20pt — page margins
DesignTokens.Spacing.xl   // 24pt — header spacing
DesignTokens.Spacing.xxl  // 32pt — section spacing
```

## Layout Constants

```swift
DesignTokens.Layout.pageMargin      // 20pt — horizontal page padding
DesignTokens.Layout.sectionSpacing   // 32pt — between content groups
DesignTokens.Layout.cardSpacing      // 12pt — between cards
DesignTokens.Layout.bottomSafeArea   // 120pt — floating CTA clearance
DesignTokens.Layout.headerBottom     // 24pt — below nav header
```

## Corner Radii

| Token | Value | Usage |
|---|---|---|
| `.xs` | 4pt | Progress bars |
| `.sm` | 8pt | Small cards, pills |
| `.md` | 12pt | Standard cards, inputs |
| `.lg` | 16pt | Large cards, bubbles |
| `.xl` | 20pt | Video buttons |
| `.xxl` | 25pt | Primary buttons (capsule) |

## Colors

Access via `Color.AppColors.*`. Key tokens:
- `primary` / `primaryDark` — Brand teal, CTAs
- `textPrimary` / `textSecondary` / `grayText` — Text hierarchy
- `backgroundMain` / `backgroundSecondary` — Screen backgrounds
- `card` / `cardBackground` — Card surfaces
- `sheetBackground` — Bottom sheets
- `destructive` / `error` / `success` / `warning` — Semantic states

Light mode must feel premium: white sheets, reduced shadow opacity (0.08), white cards with shadow.

## Buttons

Use existing components from `step/Views/SharedViews/Buttons/`:
- `PrimaryButton` — Main CTA (56pt height, capsule, scale 0.97 + medium haptic)
- `SecondaryButton` — Alternatives (56pt, bordered, scale 0.97 + light haptic)
- `DestructiveTextButton` — Delete/logout (heavy haptic)
- `HeaderIconButton` — Nav bar icons (.back, .close, .sparkles)

**All interactive elements** must have:
- Minimum 44x44pt tap target (`DesignTokens.ButtonMetrics.minTapTarget`)
- Scale feedback on press
- Haptic feedback

## Cards & Shadows

Cards must have depth — never flat on background:
```swift
.background(Color.AppColors.cardBackground)
.cornerRadius(DesignTokens.CornerRadius.lg)
.shadow(color: Color.AppColors.shadowLight, radius: 4, x: 0, y: 2)
```

## Hero Image (Detail Screens)

320pt height, 16:9 fill, bottom corners rounded 20pt, 4-stop gradient overlay. Use `DesignTokens.HeroImage.*` tokens.

## Animation

- Spring over easing: `response: 0.3, damping: 0.8`
- Entrances: 0.3s, Exits: 0.2s
- Image fade-in: 0.3s
- Respect reduced motion — use opacity cross-fades

## Anti-Patterns — NEVER Do
- Hardcode hex colors → use `Color.AppColors.*`
- Use `.font(.system(...))` → use `.scaledFont()`
- Create tap targets < 44pt
- Ship screens without Loading + Empty states
- Leave cards flat without shadows
- Use opaque overlays on video → use `.floatingControlBackground()`
- Use HStack for icon+label media controls → always VStack (icon above text)
